╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                                                                    │
│  Select an option:                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                    │
│  ▸ Install sysc-lock                                                                                               │
│      Builds and installs sysc-lock, then enables its user service                                                  │
│                                                                                                                    │
│    Uninstall sysc-lock                                                                                             │
│      Stops the service and removes the binary and user unit                                                        │
│                                                                                                                    │
│  Runs as you, never as root. Never edits PAM.                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                    │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

                                   ↑/↓: Navigate  •  Enter: Continue  •  Ctrl+C: Quit                                   
